<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3880/85  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8254/59  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0559/64  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5115/25  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     37.70/73   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.1502/12  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1784.4/4.7 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     117.81/86  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.9940/15  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.6032/92  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.9529/49  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6074/84</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$322.40/90</p>
</text>
